  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n**[(1)/(5) of (35-5)+4]²-[9-{7+(2-3)}+5]²**\n\n**Concept:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/c7a9b9173e89d44a854cc9c8053cf1e4425472078909d5687a2dfa61a2ec670c.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n**[(1)/(5) of (35-5)+4]²-[9-{7+(2-3)}+5]²**\n\n⇒ [(1)/(5) of 30+4]²-[9-{7+(-1)}+5]²\n\n⇒ (6 + 4)² - [9 - 6 + 5]²\n\n⇒ 10² - 8² \n\n⇒ 100 - 64 = 36\n\n**∴ The simplified value is 36**",
